PROJECT.md
# The dataset itself is 10 MB of regenerable model output, but its meta is
# the provenance of everything trained downstream — same reasoning as
# runs/baseline.
data/*
!data/*_meta.json
!data/*_stats.json
# Run artifacts stay out, except the baseline eval reports: they are small
# JSON and they are the evidence behind the numbers everything else is
# measured against. The generation cache under runs/cache/ is not evidence,
# it is megabytes of regenerable model output.
# Run artifacts: the evidence is small and text, the adapters are 35 MB each
# and the generation cache is megabytes of regenerable model output. Two levels
# of nesting because runs/seeds/<tag>/ exists.
runs/*
!runs/*/
runs/*/*
!runs/*/*/
runs/*/*/*
!runs/baseline/*.json
!runs/*.md
!runs/*/*.md
!runs/*/summary.md
!runs/*/config.json
!runs/*/log.jsonl
!runs/*/eval_step*.json
!runs/*/*.json
!runs/*/*/summary.md
!runs/*/*/config.json
!runs/*/*/log.jsonl
!runs/*/*/eval_step*.json
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
